00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.590
who, you know, shares the same values.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.546
So I'm gonna go ahead and
just introduce myself.

00:03:01.546 --> 00:03:03.129
- No! No!

00:03:03.129 --> 00:03:05.070
You can't go into Mr. Mahina's room.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:05.903
Are you crazy?

00:03:05.903 --> 00:03:07.020
