00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.250
You made your point clear, man.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.390
- Thank you very much, Jake.
- I'm good.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:16.230
- I think it's best.
- And what?

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.437
- What? No, Jake, wait!

00:03:17.437 --> 00:03:18.270
Jake!

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:21.020
(dramatic music)

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.263
- Come on, man.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.530
