I am solar-powered.

00:09:21.464 --> 00:09:24.047
(boss yelling)

00:09:28.144 --> 00:09:30.811
(Boss laughing)

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.400
- Really?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.287
You like that one, huh?

00:09:37.287 --> 00:09:39.000
- Oh, thanks so much, Adam.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.610
Terrific.
(Boss laughing)

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.620
Best interview I've ever been a part of

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.153
in my entire life.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.193
Okay, who's next?

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.210
You? Ready? Let's go.

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.116
Chop. Chop. Here we go.

00:09:52.116 --> 00:09:54.783
(Boss clapping)

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.390
Come on, let's go.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.282
- Okay.

00:10:00.282 --> 00:10:01.843
Woo-hoo!

00:10:01.843 --> 00:10:02.940
Hoo!

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:05.910
Requesting permission
to come onboard, sir.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.710
Hi. Noah Sanders is the name.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.850
Sorry to hear about your brother.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.740
Maybe we can get some
Chinese food after this?

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:11.573
- Alright. Alright.

00:10:11.573 --> 00:10:12.513
Okay. Take it easy.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.831
Geez. Settle down, Turbo.

00:10:15.831 --> 00:10:18.498
(muzak playing)

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.130
- Welcome to the team, Mr. Wise.

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:23.963
- Thank you.

00:10:23.963 --> 00:10:28.620
- Now, being an Arizona
Assistant State's Attorney

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.970
is an important job -

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:31.740
one we take very seriously.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:35.910
In fact, we are willing
to do anything to win.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:36.900
- It's my honor, sir.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.760
And I look forward to
serving the State of Arizona.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.410
Are these marbles?

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.283
- How's that?

00:10:42.264 --> 00:10:44.664
- I was just admiring
your container of marbles.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.520
- Why, yes.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.050
My wife got them for me as a gift

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.443
for my birthday,

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.590
which brings me to a speech

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.390
I like to give anyone

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.130
on their first day here

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.380
at the State's Attorney Office

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.553
of Arizona.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.010
You see,

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.750
Lady Justice

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.190
is a committed woman.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:10.290
She's a slippery little scallop,

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.514
as you can observe.

00:11:11.514 --> 00:11:14.264
(dramatic music)

00:11:16.176 --> 00:11:18.634
(magical music)

00:11:18.634 --> 00:11:20.029
She doesn't cook. Doesn't clean.

00:11:20.029 --> 00:11:21.470
But what she does do

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.253
is she'll turn a blind eye...

00:11:23.253 --> 00:11:25.920
(magical music)

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.990
What is going on?

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:34.823
- What?

00:11:34.823 --> 00:11:36.240
- What are you doing?

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:37.073
- Oh.

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.300
I...

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.740
These marbles. They're just...

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.573
I gotta tell you,

00:11:41.573 --> 00:11:43.530
they're just so beautiful.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:45.480
I was wondering what it would feel like

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.313
in my mouth.

00:11:46.313 --> 00:11:47.430
Like, what would the marbles feel like

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.552
if they were in my mouth?

00:11:48.552 --> 00:11:49.830
(Clayton laughs)
That's...

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.150
You know.

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:51.983
- What?

00:11:52.831 --> 00:11:53.910
- Just, you know,

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:54.743
you know,

00:11:54.743 --> 00:11:55.710
like, just what would it feel like

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:56.610
if there were just kind of

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.260
a whole ton of marbles

00:11:58.260 --> 00:11:59.763
in my face?

00:12:01.591 --> 00:12:03.120
- Well, don't do that.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:03.953
Just...

00:12:05.101 --> 00:12:06.312
Just don't do that.

00:12:06.312 --> 00:12:07.145
- Yeah.

00:12:07.145 --> 00:12:07.978
Yeah, of course.

00:12:07.978 --> 00:12:09.090
Of course.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:09.923
Why?

00:12:09.923 --> 00:12:10.756
What am I doing over here?

00:12:10.756 --> 00:12:11.589
I mean, that's a thing

00:12:11.589 --> 00:12:13.120
that a child would do.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:13.953
You were saying?

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.960
- I was saying that Lady Justice,

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:22.080
she just stands there in my office,

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.543
looking at me.
(dramatic music)

00:12:27.141 --> 00:12:28.730
(marbles clacking)

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:31.311
(dramatic music)

00:12:31.311 --> 00:12:34.232
(marbles clacking)

00:12:34.232 --> 00:12:36.982
(dramatic music)

00:12:46.301 --> 00:12:47.134
- Clayton!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.063
Forget the marbles, boy!

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:54.333
Spit the marbles out, please.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.013
There you go.

00:12:58.642 --> 00:13:01.559
(marbles clacking)

00:13:05.672 --> 00:13:07.122
Well.

00:13:07.122 --> 00:13:07.955
Alright.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:11.113
Ah.

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:18.510
How many...

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:19.343
Really?

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.450
Do you have any...
(marble hits floor)

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.320
(foot stomps)

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.750
I'm gonna wait for the last...

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:28.590
I'm assuming there's...

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:29.423
Yeah.

00:13:31.982 --> 00:13:33.782
I know there's another one in there.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:38.663
- No.

00:13:38.663 --> 00:13:40.144
- Alright, well then...

00:13:40.144 --> 00:13:40.977
(marbles clacking)

00:13:40.977 --> 00:13:41.810
- I am...

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:42.643
I'm...

00:13:42.643 --> 00:13:43.920
They're just so beautiful, I can't...

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.000
It's just these marbles.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.833
I gotta tell you, I...

00:13:45.833 --> 00:13:47.850
- You obviously don't take
this job very seriously.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:48.683
- I do, sir.

00:13:48.683 --> 00:13:49.980
It's just these particular marbles.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.210
I just needed to feel

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.740
what they felt like in my mouth.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.260
I don't know what is wrong with me.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.090
- You know we do serious
business here, right?

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.080
- Yes, I do know that.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.640
I'm 100% aware of that. Yep.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.440
- 'Cause I've forgotten where I was!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.870
- You were saying that Justice
is a dumb blind old lady.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:04.890
I heard every word.
- Yes.

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:05.723
No!

00:14:05.723 --> 00:14:07.833
She's not dumb.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.850
But she is blind.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.620
She's reminiscent of

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.667
Kerry Washington.

00:14:14.667 --> 00:14:17.417
(dramatic music)

00:14:24.262 --> 00:14:25.213
Good god!

00:14:25.213 --> 00:14:28.402
(marbles clattering)

00:14:28.402 --> 00:14:29.861
(Clayton grunting)

00:14:29.861 --> 00:14:33.111
(vocalizing excitedly)

00:14:37.762 --> 00:14:40.595
(Clayton choking)

00:14:50.104 --> 00:14:53.187
(marbles clattering)

00:14:54.333 --> 00:14:56.916
(choral music)

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:08.253
Janice, send in the cleanup crew.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.864
Another one fell for the marble trick.

00:15:13.864 --> 00:15:16.197
(chuckling)

00:15:22.653 --> 00:15:25.153
(theme music)

